║                    ║░
║  PARQDB  │  CACHE  ║░
║                    ║░
╚════════════════════╝░
<span class="ascii-shadow-bottom"> ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░</span></pre>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section id="architecture-panel-browser" class="architecture-scene" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="architecture-tab-browser" data-architecture-panel="browser" hidden>
              <pre class="runtime-diagram diagram-desktop" aria-label="ParqDB WebAssembly in a browser tab with a browser cache">╔═ BROWSER TAB ══════╗
║                    ║░
║PARQDB WASM │ CACHE ║░
║                    ║░
